  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 411 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E22", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The Eugia US LLC product (NDC 55150012316) lists Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3004446312) as a registered plant for analysis and manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1286862 of that plant ended on 2025-09-05 and was classified OAI, with the classification known on 2025-12-04.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 411 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E22", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same product also names Apitoria Pharma Private Limited (FEI 3004051616) for analysis and API manufacture, and EUGIA SEZ PRIVATE LIMITED (FEI 3011905047) for analysis, manufacture, and pack, both with VAI inspection histories.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A separate Heritage/Avet product (NDC 23155090641) names Antibiotice SA as the manufacturing plant, but that plant is not placed in FDA registration data.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across the three Corvale sites ranges from 16 to 23 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
